# Keeps the build context small. The suites need src/, include/, test/, priv/,
# otp_src/, config/, protocols/, rebar.* and the Makefile, so none of those may
# be excluded here.
#
# protocols/ in particular: the `test' profile compiles it through
# {extra_src_dirs, ["protocols", "test/otp"]}, and it holds the gossip and
# consensus backends, among them the one the property suites broadcast through.
# Excluding it yields an image in which those modules do not exist, and the
# suites that call them fail as undefined.
_build/
deps/
doc/
.git/
.github/
_notes/
.claude/
old-bin/
analysis/
annotations/
*.dump
*.crashdump
erl_crash.dump
TEST-*.xml
results.csv
*.beam
.DS_Store
test/fly/.env
